<div class="card-grid astro-zntqmydn"><article class="card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc"> <p class="title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc">  <span class="astro-v5tidmuc">New to terminal multiplexers?</span> </p> <div class="body astro-v5tidmuc"><p>You don’t need to learn shortcuts to start. Herdr is mouse-first: click panes, drag borders, split and switch from right-click menus.</p><p><a href="/docs/quick-start/">Quick start →</a></p></div> </article> <article class="card sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc"> <p class="title sl-flex astro-v5tidmuc">  <span class="astro-v5tidmuc">Coming from tmux or zellij?</span> </p> <div class="body astro-v5tidmuc"><p>You already know the model. The prefix is <code dir="auto">ctrl+b</code>, panes persist, detach and reattach work the way you expect.</p><p><a href="/docs/concepts/">Concepts →</a> · <a href="/docs/configuration/#keybindings">Keybindings →</a></p></div> </article> </div> 
